= Trifón Gómez

Trifón Gómez is a leading figure of the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> and the union's foremost advocate on economic policy. His central idea is to follow Prieto's lead and use a massive public-works program - roads, railways, and above all the great hydraulic works - to stimulate demand and pull the country out of the depression.

- @plan
- @carry_out_policy
- @depression
- @root: Return to main

@plan
title: Adopt the public-works plan!
subtitle: Convince the rest of the party to back the public-works program.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted == 0 and wtb_concept and black_thursday_seen and ((labor_strength >= center_strength) and (labor_strength >= left_strength)) and wtb_points >= 160
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_adopted = 1; economic_plan = 1; labor_strength += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent -= 5
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the public-works plan. ?][? if wtb_points < 160 : The plan is still being ironed out. ?][? if (labor_strength < center_strength or labor_strength < left_strength): The UGT wing is not strong enough. ?]

With enough groundwork laid, we have convinced the party to formally adopt the public-works plan as its answer to the depression. If the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> holds the Finance Ministry, we can begin putting it into effect.

@carry_out_policy
title: Carry out the economic plan.
subtitle: If we are in government, we can carry out the public-works program.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if wtb_adopted == 0 : We have not yet adopted an economic plan. ?][? if works_program >= 2 : We have already started implementing the plan. ?][? if finance_minister_party != "PSOE" or not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> does not hold the Finance Ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted and works_program <= 1 and finance_minister_party == "PSOE" and psoe_in_government
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_policy_timer -= 12
go-to: economic_policy


@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to get us out of the economic crisis.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the public-works plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 5; wtb_points += 15

[? if not wtb_concept: The UGT's economists have been working to draft a plan for getting the country out of the depression. Gómez canvasses in favor of a public-works program throughout the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> and the unions. ?][? if wtb_concept: The public-works plan has been taken up as the unions' answer to the depression. Gómez canvasses in favor of it throughout the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> and the unions. ?]
